{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anthropics/claude-code/main/schemas/mcp.json",
  "mcpServers": {
    // --- Uncomment and configure servers for your project ---
    //
    // An MCP server runs with your user's permissions and its tool output
    // reaches the agent, so treat each entry like a dependency
    // (.claude/rules/dependency-security.md, Rule 7):
    //   - Pin an exact version, published at least 3 days ago
    //     (`npm view <pkg> time`). Never an unpinned `npx -y <pkg>`.
    //   - Adding or bumping a server is a reviewed change: name the package,
    //     version, publish date and the credentials it receives in the PR.
    //   - Pass credentials by reference (`${VAR}`), never as literal values.
    // The versions below were the newest 3+ days old on 2026-11-04. The
    // github and postgres packages are old reference servers no longer
    // updated; prefer a maintained replacement where one exists.

